From fee8b01ec182b64be3a9800099e794e921a1b146 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jingyuan Tian <49518565+CubeLander@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 12:56:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(spec-decode): backport DeepSeek V4 DSpark fixes
 (#240)

Backport the DeepSeek V4 DSpark configuration fixes, preserve target quantization, resolve drafting token IDs fail-closed, and add regression coverage.
---
